    "description": "Objective\n\nEstablish the Sign-Up working status model so Reps can move a record through a defined lifecycle.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Status__c picklist values: New; In Progress; Completed; Archived; Flagged\n\n* New = default on record creation\n\n* In Progress = set by Rep when accepting a Sign-Up to work\n\n* Completed = set by Rep once all required information is captured\n\n* Archived = set by Rep when the Sign-Up will not be completed (Closed-Lost equivalent)\n\n* Flagged = set by Rep or Ops when the record is suspicious or fraudulent\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* All five values available and defaulted correctly\n\n* Rep can move a record through the lifecycle from the record page\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nSUPERSEDED IN PART by BUILD-18 (Doc #17) — Flagged was later removed from the core status set and fraud moved to Fraud Flag + Fraud Review Status. This ticket is retained to record the work delivered.\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 1.",
